completions_3:
James runs 3 sprints a session, and each sprint is 60 meters, so he runs 3 * 60 = 180 meters per session.

He does this 3 times per week, so he runs 180 * 3 = 540 meters per week.

\boxed{540}

completions_0:
Cynthia eats one serving of ice cream every night. After 60 days, she will have eaten a total of 60 servings of ice cream. Since each carton has 15 servings, she needs to buy 60 / 15 = 4 cartons of ice cream.

Each carton costs $4.00, so the total cost will be 4 * $4.00 = $16.00.

\boxed{16}

